{"3834930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Liar Zoo Game", "steam_appid": 3834930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・At the start of the game, players are automatically dealt 5 attacking and defending cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Attacker cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 Lions (attack power 2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 Zebras (attack power 1)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 Cat (attack power 0)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Defender cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tranquilizer gun (defense 2) CT (cooldown) 2 turns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rope (defense 1) CT (cooldown) 1 turn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bare hands (defense 0) No CT (cooldown)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※Once an attacker card has been used, it cannot be used again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※CT (cooldown) means that once a card has been used, the same defensive card cannot be used for that turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆How to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・When the game starts, the attacker or defender will be decided at random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The attacker and defender each place one card from their hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The cards are revealed at the same time, and the attack power and defense power values at that time are compared, and the defender takes damage equal to the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・After three turns, the attacking and defending sides switch roles, and the players then set and reveal cards and deal damage in the same way until a winner is decided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The player with the most life wins when they have depleted their opponent's life or run out of cards.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・At the start of the game, players are automatically dealt 5 attacking and defending cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Attacker cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 Lions (attack power 2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 Zebras (attack power 1)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 Cat (attack power 0)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Defender cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tranquilizer gun (defense 2) CT (cooldown) 2 turns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rope (defense 1) CT (cooldown) 1 turn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bare hands (defense 0) No CT (cooldown)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※Once an attacker card has been used, it cannot be used again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※CT (cooldown) means that once a card has been used, the same defensive card cannot be used for that turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆How to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・When the game starts, the attacker or defender will be decided at random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The attacker and defender each place one card from their hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The cards are revealed at the same time, and the attack power and defense power values at that time are compared, and the defender takes damage equal to the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・After three turns, the attacking and defending sides switch roles, and the players then set and reveal cards and deal damage in the same way until a winner is decided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The player with the most life wins when they have depleted their opponent's life or run out of cards.</p>", "short_description": "Born from the Fuji TV FOD program &quot;Dennou Yuugi Saikou Kaigi&quot;! A ferocious lion, a cute cat, or... Read your opponent's mind and fight! &quot;Liar Zoo Game&quot;", "supported_languages": "Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834930/bde0d151e0b41d66708089477c0e060bfd96964b/header.jpg?t=1753706292", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s